    kind: work_item  # 9891
    title: "No check that a node id's name slot equals the sanitized Symbol.name (ADR-0036 Ruling 1 round-trip): the ADR records it as not landed and nothing tracks it"  # 9891
    status: todo_hard  # 9891
    priority: 3  # 9891
