- op: discuss  # 5659
  at: '2026-11-16T04:57:54Z'  # 5659
  by: agent  # 5659
  actor: jgstern_agent  # 5659
  clock: 3  # 5659
  nonce: '5659'  # 5659
  message: "Done in PR #2198. Measured first, on six maps from this branch (pretix, openzeppelin, chatwoot, postal, a mastodon sub-tree, rabbitmq deps/rabbit): 14,056 of 97,574 nodes have a name slot that is not the sanitized Symbol.name; 5,919 are file pseudo-symbols, whose slot is the literal `file` by Ruling 3 and which are exempt by rule; the rest: JavaScript anonymous callbacks 6,604, solidity-abi stand-ins 1,250, Vue directives 255, event-sourcing raw colons 19 (WI-dodom), Maven 7, websocket 1, tsconfig 1. So the check is a per-run STATISTIC, validation_report.name_slot_stats (ids checked, exempt, mismatched, by producer, capped at 20), not a violation per node; report schema 0.4 -> 0.5; cost 5-10 ms. ADR-0036's status line and Enforcement section say what is enforced. knex: 6,361 of 12,385 mismatch; caddy: 0 of 6,389. The families are filed separately with what each fix would move."  # 5659
